    {
      "node_id": "kg_doc_7",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Martina Navratilova and Pam Shriver were the defending champions. With Navratilova absent from the tournament, Shriver teamed up with Hana Mandlíková and lost in the first round. Jana Novotná and Helena Suková won the title, defeating Patty Fendick and Mary Joe Fernández 7–6, 7–6.",
      "depth": 0,
      "parent_id": null,
